  "verifiedBehaviors": [
    "Original preparation is readable only by its owning authenticated session with current Assistant/endpoint/provider/schema access; no grant or dispatch on GET.",
    "A second login by the same Owner cannot read the first session preparation.",
    "Browser reload preserves the original arguments and preparation idempotency key.",
    "Lost approval and lost dispatch responses reuse identical commands; the dispatched action has one initial claim.",
    "Persistent permission reuse admits a freshly prepared matching action without a new grant.",
    "Denial, stale revision rejection, revocation and expired authentication preserve server authority and clear obsolete actions.",
    "Request pages are bounded, preserve unique identities across next-page reads and support server state filtering.",
    "Actual script-like input is rendered as text.",
    "Desktop 1440x900, 390x844 and 320px page widths and a 720px reflow equivalent to 200% of a 1440px viewport have no horizontal page overflow; keyboard approval was exercised.",
    "Browser restart exposed old HTTP sockets reaching a stopped server. Bounded shutdown now closes remaining connections, with a separate socket regression test."
  ],
